{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01RJC5fqhDL7QqWw7Lvwt7GR","type":"tool_result","content":"=== PR json ===\n{\"baseRefName\":\"main\",\"body\":\"## Summary\\n\\nIsolate the verbatim root README Quickstart walk from the runner's ambient global `netscript` installation. Every spawned README command shares a run-owned `DENO_INSTALL_ROOT` and PATH prefix, index 0 fail-closed removes any stale `<runRoot>/.deno-install` before recreating it, and receipts prove the isolation without changing README argv.\\n\\n## Scope\\n\\n- Archetype / area: Archetype 6 gate code in `packages/cli/e2e` (no product code, README, workflow, or cleanup-gate change)\\n- Part of #1881\\n- Part of #863\\n- No closing keyword: #1881 closes only after the green hosted transcript.\\n\\n## Exact red\\n\\nCanary 9 `e2e-cli-prod` run `33704697088` at `v0.0.7-canary.9`: `scaffold.runtime` and `quickstart.walk` passed; `readme.quickstart.01-install-cli` failed, exit 1, receipt `01.json`.\\n\\n- argv: `deno install --global --allow-all --name netscript jsr:@netscript/cli@0.0.7-canary.9`\\n- stderr: `error: Existing installation found. Aborting (Use -f to overwrite).`\\n- Cause: the earlier workflow install owns ambient global `netscript`; the README executor inherited that environment.\\n- `cleanup.aspire-stop` is downstream and intentionally untouched.\\n\\n## Slices\\n\\n- [x] RED: recording spawn seam proves the README command environment is not isolated — `b1aafaaa6`\\n- [x] GREEN: run-owned install environment on every spawned README command, fail-closed stale-root removal at index 0, receipt `environment` evidence, `--allow-env=PATH` on the walker command — `0650f6f7b`\\n- [x] Scoped gate evidence (below)\\n- [ ] Separate-session IMPL-EVAL\\n\\n## RED / GREEN\\n\\n- RED (`b1aafaaa6`): focused structured test exited 1; 0 passed, 1 failed. Expected `DENO_INSTALL_ROOT=<runRoot>/.deno-install`, actual `undefined`. The exact argv and no-`-f` assertions passed before the environment assertion.\\n- GREEN (`0650f6f7b`): the same test seeds a stale `<runRoot>/.deno-install/bin/netscript`, proves it is removed at index 0, asserts index 0 argv is verbatim (no `-f`), asserts `DENO_INSTALL_ROOT` and the PATH prepend on the spawn, asserts index 1 inherits the identical persisted environment, and asserts receipt `environment: { denoInstallRoot, pathPrepend }`. Suite test asserts every walker command carries `--allow-env=PATH` (the walker reads ambient `PATH` to build the prepend; without the grant the walk fails `NotCapable` at command 1).\\n\\n## Validation\\n\\n- No runtime suite, Aspire command, or Docker command was run.\\n- Scoped `run-deno-check.ts` on `packages/cli/e2e`: 234 files / 0 errors.\\n- Scoped `run-deno-test.ts` on `packages/cli/e2e`: 327 passed / 0 failed.\\n- Scoped `run-deno-fmt.ts --ext ts,tsx` and changed-file lint: clean.\\n- `deno task e2e:cli gates readme.quickstart`: lists all 11 README gates + `cleanup.aspire-stop`.\\n- Supervisor re-ran the two focused test files (5 passed / 0 failed) and the gate listing independently at `0650f6f7b`.\\n\\n## Harness\\n\\n- Run dir: `.llm/runs/research-aspire-13.5-adoption--0.0.7/slices/leaf-1881-fix/`\\n- Phase: `impl`\\n- PLAN-EVAL: N/A — small mechanical fix with owner-locked contract, scope, assertions, gates, and prohibited alternatives.\\n- Do not merge until the mandatory separate-session IMPL-EVAL is complete.\\n\\n## Drift / Debt\\n\\n- Supervisor live-diff audit caught two gaps in the first GREEN attempt (missing `--allow-env=PATH`; stale root not removed); both fixed by the same worker in `0650f6f7b` before any green commit.\\n\\n## Definition of Done\\n\\n- [x] Every spawned README command uses the same run-owned install environment; index 0 removes a pre-existing install root fail-closed.\\n- [x] README argv remains verbatim except existing placeholder substitution; no `-f`.\\n- [x] Receipt records `denoInstallRoot` and `pathPrepend`.\\n- [x] Requested scoped gates pass.\\n- [ ] Separate-session IMPL-EVAL is recorded.\\n\\n**Post-merge proof (not a merge DoD item, not yet proven):** hosted green comes from dispatching `e2e-cli-prod.yml` from `main` with `published-version=0.0.7-canary.9` after this merges; that transcript is what closes #1881. This PR does not close #1881.\\n\",\"headRefName\":\"fix/aspire-1881-readme-install-isolation\",\"headRefOid\":\"0650f6f7bda0f9241424cce9882b405f4e6b6d55\",\"isDraft\":false,\"labels\":[{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOSxcnO88AAAACoEUaLw\",\"name\":\"type:fix\",\"description\":\"\",\"color\":\"ededed\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOSxcnO88AAAACoEUaNA\",\"name\":\"area:cli\",\"description\":\"\",\"color\":\"ededed\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOSxcnO88AAAACoEUaOA\",\"name\":\"status:impl\",\"description\":\"\",\"color\":\"ededed\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOSxcnO88AAAACo4z65g\",\"name\":\"area:aspire\",\"description\":\"\",\"color\":\"ededed\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOSxcnO88AAAACp3ynyQ\",\"name\":\"gate:e2e\",\"description\":\"\",\"color\":\"d4c5f9\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOSxcnO88AAAACp6nO2g\",\"name\":\"priority:p0\",\"description\":\"Critical / release blocker\",\"color\":\"b60205\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOSxcnO88AAAACy-P1_Q\",\"name\":\"orchestrator:aspire\",\"description\":\"Owned by the 0.0.7 Aspire orchestrator\",\"color\":\"F9D0C4\"}],\"mergeStateStatus\":\"BLOCKED\",\"mergeable\":\"MERGEABLE\",\"milestone\":{\"number\":27,\"title\":\"0.0.7\",\"description\":\"Typed extension and generation foundation. Ship order: RFC 0001 SDK/client slices S1–S8; plugin CLI contribution RFC #1502; route/client/UI scaffold corrections (#1354, #1355, #1357, #1358, #1360); then actionable follow-ups (#1429, #1448, #1451–#1453, #1455, #1458, #1461–#1462, #1481, #1533, #1544, #1551), SQLite scaffold cleanup #1588, Fresh navigation coordinator #1590, typed OpenAI Responses mapping #1591, durable typed worker progress #1592, and existing MySQL/docs/public-surface fixes. Invalid cache-suppression proposal #1550 is closed and intentionally excluded; its remaining di